{"id":155764225,"slug":"flowers-for-ramaswamy","title":"Flowers for Ramaswamy","subtitle":"Vivek leaves Elon Musk alone to cut spending, and we bid farewell.","post_date":"2025-01-26T15:13:42.515Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/flowers-for-ramaswamy","wordcount":271,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:49:14.773Z","body_sha256":"724cf028993a05ccfb5bc6525e85ab1fc36a0355e2f35c43d46faacd99ee03b5","text_words":272,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The semi-governmental department of government efficiency (DOGE) was supposed to be helmed by the power twins of venture backed entrepreneurship: Elon Musk and Vivek Ramaswamy.   The division of labor, in theory, was that a Elon would focus on cutting spending, and Vivek would focus on reducing “unnecessary regulations.”  Alas, in a scene reminiscent of the Friend break up between Magneto and professor Xavier, Vivek has departed the semi-administration with Scaramucci-like alacrity.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Utfx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff172d052-afc1-4e70-8eeb-58c57e3f3424_1200x800.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Utfx!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff172d052-afc1-4e70-8eeb-58c57e3f3424_1200x800.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Utfx!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff172d052-afc1-4e70-8eeb-58c57e3f3424_1200x800.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Utfx!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_