 width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><div><hr></div><p>Tomorrow, and the next day, and a minimum of one day after that,</p><p>Creeps in this excessively regulated pace from day to subsequent day,</p><p>To the last moment of 2025, which, by executive order, has been declared the end of time;</p><p>And all our prior administrations have pointed civil service careers</p><p>The way to dusty death. Out, out, brief service to the nation!</p><p>Regulatory work is but a bust, a theranos-level founder,</p><p>That raises funds and hand waves her hour upon LinkedIn,</p><p>And then is indicted for investor fraud. It is a tale</p><p>Told by an idiot, full of promises and vitriol,</p><p>Reforming nothing.</p><div><hr></div><p>Thank you for reading. Our best luck to Mr. R. In whatever run for public office he chooses for himself in the great state of Ohio.  We kept this column short, in keeping with the culture of the administration and the tenure of the Vivek’s career in it.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/flowers-for-ramaswamy?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/flowers-for-ramaswamy?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"The semi-governmental department of government efficiency (DOGE) was supposed to be helmed by the power twins of venture backed entrepreneurship: Elon Musk and Vivek Ramaswamy. The division of labor, in theory, was that a Elon would focus on cutting spending, and Vivek would focus on reducing “unnecessary regulations.” Alas, in a scene reminiscent of the Friend break up between Magneto and professor Xavier, Vivek has departed the semi-administration with Scaramucci-like alacrity.\n\nMr. Scaramucci, famously, spent 11 days as a member of the first Trump administration, before exiting stage left.\n\nToday, based on a request of my readers — and, critically, the mothers of my readers— I'm going to be doing a Shakespearean tribute to Mr. Ramaswamy.\n\nShare\n\nTomorrow, and the next day, and a minimum of one day after that,\n\nCreeps in this excessively regulated pace from day to subsequent day,\n\nTo the last moment of 2025, which, by executive order, has been declared the end of time;\n\nAnd all our prior administrations have pointed civil service careers\n\nThe way to dusty death. Out, out, brief service to the nation!\n\nRegulatory work is but a bust, a theranos-level founder,\n\nThat raises funds and hand waves her hour upon LinkedIn,\n\nAnd then is indicted for investor fraud. It is a tale\n\nTold by an idiot, full of promises and vitriol,\n\nReforming nothing.\n\nThank you for reading. Our best luck to Mr. R. In whatever run for public office he chooses for himself in the great state of Ohio. We kept this column short, in keeping with the culture of the administration and the tenure of the Vivek’s career in it.\n\nShare\n\nSubscribe now"}